{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your fate in this <strong>NON-LINEAR HIGH-FANTASY ADVENTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FURAX THE INDESTRUCTIBLE</strong>, fleshless carcass and soulless body, has arrived through an inter-dimensional rift in the colorful, carefree world of \u00c9meyralia, to spread <strong>SADNESS</strong> and <strong>DESPAIR</strong>. Nothing seems to be able to stop him: his influence grows daily, many disciples join him and <strong>NIGHTMARE CREATURES</strong> appear on every continent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to the prophecy, only <strong>THE ORACLE</strong> could defeat him, but he retired centuries ago. To find him, the 7 keys held by the 7 rulers of the 7 islands of the Emerald Archipelago must be gathered. <strong>FOUR HEROES</strong>, the bravest of the brave, are chosen for this quest. The future of Emeyralia is in their hands. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point-and-click</strong> exploration and gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based</strong> yet <strong>fast</strong> <strong>combat</strong> system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of (poorly) <strong>hand-drawn</strong> unique illustrations  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the main quest or explore the <strong>open world</strong> and start side quests </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>7 biomes</strong> with villages, cities, dungeons, caves, forests and so on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately <strong>5-10 hours</strong> long on a first playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Might and Magic 3-8</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Synth Music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010290/extras/ae561d4ab9fbb5fa8146cb34e68c2149.poster.avif?t=1762332574\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010290/extras/ae561d4ab9fbb5fa8146cb34e68c2149.webm?t=1762332574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010290/extras/ae561d4ab9fbb5fa8146cb34e68c2149.mp4?t=1762332574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Defeat Furax","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010290/1dcc8cf84a2e87bf2b21d8d326288bd87f88c848.jpg"},{"name":"Lost and found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010290/70e62567c2339e813ff54147d6166bb0d82ec8bc.jpg"},{"name":"Shepherd","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010290/3cfdddfe1649d96564dc65cb7bce6bf626a184d0.jpg"},{"name":"Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010290/89b72948d32ef11d4326494ed22e09fffd45453a.jpg"},{"name":"Master of the Toads","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010290/83550db6606ca0fc27e93e7941e6c0ae7f32f316.jpg"},{"name":"Dragon Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010290/7986ead1c9d2045cfb37dd4e674e56d241a5fb6f.jpg"},{"name":"Meet Neow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010290/53860ac7c7f878f5d1a568e337c2f0fe082533ef.jpg"},{"name":"Night Vision","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010290/a9dd19ae37786b9565a96e6879634ec8decc0705.jpg"},{"name":"Vampire Survivors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010290/ce6c0d824b5701a63487638e73b4b656f97d6bb6.jpg"},{"name":"The Last Pharaoh","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010290/5f27c4f6a39fc7c53fe2ba766b57a6f8bb93baac.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3010290?t=1762332574","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3010290?t=1762332574","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010290/94d6feee7ebafc234b0645561c2673e490a38d80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762332574","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010290/94d6feee7ebafc234b0645561c2673e490a38d80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762332574","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3346810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>MADE BY HAND</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A (poorly) hand-drawn tribute to Classic RPG and Comic Books</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEROES OF THE SEVEN ISLANDS</strong> is a comfy yet challenging <strong>HAND-DRAWN</strong> tribute to classic role-playing video games and <strong>COMIC BOOKS</strong>. Experience a non-linear heroic adventure with side quests in a vast light fairy tale world, inspired by 90s games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010290/extras/69319fc825c60df25d2003eeb8beadc9.avif?t=1762332574\" width=1200 height=418 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The art was all hand-drawn on paper, scanned, then coloured and animated digitally.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your fate in this <strong>NON-LINEAR HIGH-FANTASY ADVENTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FURAX THE INDESTRUCTIBLE</strong>, fleshless carcass and soulless body, has arrived through an inter-dimensional rift in the colorful, carefree world of \u00c9meyralia, to spread <strong>SADNESS</strong> and <strong>DESPAIR</strong>. Nothing seems to be able to stop him: his influence grows daily, many disciples join him and <strong>NIGHTMARE CREATURES</strong> appear on every continent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to the prophecy, only <strong>THE ORACLE</strong> could defeat him, but he retired centuries ago. To find him, the 7 keys held by the 7 rulers of the 7 islands of the Emerald Archipelago must be gathered. <strong>FOUR HEROES</strong>, the bravest of the brave, are chosen for this quest. The future of Emeyralia is in their hands. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point-and-click</strong> exploration and gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based</strong> yet <strong>fast</strong> <strong>combat</strong> system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of (poorly) <strong>hand-drawn</strong> unique illustrations  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the main quest or explore the <strong>open world</strong> and start side quests </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>7 biomes</strong> with villages, cities, dungeons, caves, forests and so on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately <strong>5-10 hours</strong> long on a first playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Might and Magic 3-8</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Synth Music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010290/extras/ae561d4ab9fbb5fa8146cb34e68c2149.poster.avif?t=1762332574\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010290/extras/ae561d4ab9fbb5fa8146cb34e68c2149.webm?t=17623